Identify all sheets before LIST, sum numeric values in columns C and D from the top of each sheet, and compute balance as C minus D.  
Clear the existing list rows, then write each sheet name, its C/D totals, and a final TOTAL row.  
Save the workbook with plain values in the answer region.

